VibeOS FPGA Top-Level Licensing
================================

This repository is an aggregate of original VibeOS FPGA work and vendored
third-party components.

Original Project Code
---------------------

Unless a file or directory carries a different license notice, code and
documentation written specifically for this repository by the VibeOS FPGA
project owner are released under The Unlicense below. To the maximum extent
allowed by law, those original portions are dedicated to the public domain.

This dedication applies only to original VibeOS FPGA code. It does not remove
or replace the licenses of third-party code included in this repository.

Third-Party Code
----------------

Vendored, imported, or derived third-party components remain under their own
licenses. Keep their copyright notices, license files, and required notices
when copying, modifying, distributing, or building from this repository.

The central third-party license inventory is:

    THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md

If a component-local license file and this top-level summary disagree, the
component-local license file controls.

